{"starts": [0.0, 6.843831999999999, 14.282915, 20.495789, 27.791995999999997, 32.757203999999994, 39.996244999999995, 48.732910999999994], "total": 56.873369, "segs": [{"text": "¿Qué pasaría si caes a la Fosa de las Marianas? Spoiler: nunca volverías a ver la luz del sol.", "words": [["Qué", 0.097625, 0.228583], ["pasaría", 0.240458, 0.657124], ["si", 0.669041, 0.811916], ["caes", 0.823791, 1.180916], ["a", 1.192875, 1.2405], ["la", 1.252375, 1.3595], ["Fosa", 1.371416, 1.657124], ["de", 1.669041, 1.764291], ["las", 1.776208, 1.930958], ["Marianas", 1.942875, 2.58575], ["Spoiler", 3.40475, 4.011875], ["nunca", 4.333333, 4.607124], ["volverías", 4.619041, 5.190457], ["a", 5.202375, 5.25], ["ver", 5.261916, 5.464291], ["la", 5.476208, 5.571458], ["luz", 5.583333, 5.809541], ["del", 5.821416, 5.952374], ["sol", 5.964291, 6.273832]], "dur": 6.623831999999999}, {"text": "Es el punto más profundo del océano: casi once mil metros bajo el agua. Más profundo de lo que mide el Everest.", "words": [["Es", 0.097625, 0.288083], ["el", 0.3, 0.407125], ["punto", 0.419041, 0.716666], ["más", 0.728583, 0.942874], ["profundo", 0.95475, 1.371416], ["del", 1.383333, 1.526208], ["océano", 1.538083, 2.014291], ["casi", 2.276208, 2.597624], ["once", 2.609541, 2.847624], ["mil", 2.859541, 3.073832], ["metros", 3.085708, 3.466666], ["bajo", 3.478583, 3.680958], ["el", 3.692875, 3.776208], ["agua", 3.788083, 4.097624], ["Más", 4.916666, 5.190457], ["profundo", 5.202375, 5.630958], ["de", 5.642875, 5.738125], ["lo", 5.75, 5.84525], ["que", 5.857125, 5.976166], ["mide", 5.988083, 6.273791], ["el", 6.285708, 6.380958], ["Everest", 6.392875, 6.869083]], "dur": 7.2190829999999995}, {"text": "A los doscientos metros ya casi no llega la luz. A los mil, la oscuridad es total.", "words": [["A", 0.097625, 0.216666], ["los", 0.228583, 0.395249], ["doscientos", 0.407125, 0.895208], ["metros", 0.907125, 1.276166], ["ya", 1.288083, 1.419041], ["casi", 1.430958, 1.764291], ["no", 1.776208, 1.954791], ["llega", 1.966666, 2.228582], ["la", 2.240458, 2.335708], ["luz", 2.347625, 2.752375], ["A", 3.571416, 3.690457], ["los", 3.702375, 3.916666], ["mil", 3.928583, 4.142874], ["la", 4.464291, 4.535707], ["oscuridad", 4.547625, 5.071416], ["es", 5.083333, 5.214291], ["total", 5.226208, 5.642874]], "dur": 5.992874}, {"text": "Y la presión se vuelve brutal: más de mil veces la de la superficie. Es como cargar cincuenta aviones encima.", "words": [["Y", 0.097625, 0.228583], ["la", 0.240458, 0.371416], ["presión", 0.383333, 0.752374], ["se", 0.764291, 0.871416], ["vuelve", 0.883333, 1.145249], ["brutal", 1.157125, 1.561875], ["más", 1.871416, 2.073791], ["de", 2.085708, 2.157124], ["mil", 2.169041, 2.395249], ["veces", 2.407125, 2.8], ["la", 2.811916, 2.883332], ["de", 2.89525, 3.002375], ["la", 3.014291, 3.097624], ["superficie", 3.109541, 3.799999], ["Es", 4.619041, 4.785707], ["como", 4.797625, 5.011916], ["cargar", 5.023791, 5.380916], ["cincuenta", 5.392875, 5.84525], ["aviones", 5.857125, 6.25], ["encima", 6.261916, 6.726207]], "dur": 7.076206999999999}, {"text": "Tus pulmones se encogerían y tus oídos se romperían mucho antes de llegar al fondo.", "words": [["Tus", 0.097625, 0.288083], ["pulmones", 0.3, 0.740458], ["se", 0.752375, 0.823791], ["encogerían", 0.835708, 1.407124], ["y", 1.419041, 1.490457], ["tus", 1.502375, 1.692833], ["oídos", 1.70475, 2.085708], ["se", 2.097625, 2.20475], ["romperían", 2.216666, 2.752374], ["mucho", 2.764291, 3.133332], ["antes", 3.14525, 3.454791], ["de", 3.466666, 3.526207], ["llegar", 3.538083, 3.871416], ["al", 3.883333, 3.978583], ["fondo", 3.990458, 4.395208]], "dur": 4.745208}, {"text": "Pero allá abajo no estarías solo: hay peces transparentes, crustáceos gigantes y criaturas que brillan en la oscuridad.", "words": [["Pero", 0.097625, 0.311916], ["allá", 0.323791, 0.538082], ["abajo", 0.55, 0.871416], ["no", 0.883333, 1.038083], ["estarías", 1.05, 1.502375], ["solo", 1.514291, 1.859541], ["hay", 2.121416, 2.288082], ["peces", 2.3, 2.621416], ["transparentes", 2.633333, 3.419041], ["crustáceos", 3.621416, 4.180957], ["gigantes", 4.192875, 4.704791], ["y", 4.716666, 4.776207], ["criaturas", 4.788083, 5.347624], ["que", 5.359541, 5.490499], ["brillan", 5.502375, 5.871416], ["en", 5.883333, 5.978583], ["la", 5.990458, 6.061874], ["oscuridad", 6.073791, 6.669041]], "dur": 7.019041}, {"text": "Solo unos pocos humanos han llegado. En dos mil doce, el director James Cameron bajó en un submarino especial, sin tocar el agua.", "words": [["Solo", 0.097625, 0.419041], ["unos", 0.430958, 0.728583], ["pocos", 0.740458, 1.073791], ["humanos", 1.085708, 1.490458], ["han", 1.502375, 1.621416], ["llegado", 1.633333, 2.085708], ["En", 2.90475, 3.083333], ["dos", 3.09525, 3.285708], ["mil", 3.297625, 3.452375], ["doce", 3.464291, 3.797624], ["el", 4.083333, 4.214291], ["director", 4.226208, 4.666666], ["James", 4.678583, 4.976208], ["Cameron", 4.988083, 5.380958], ["bajó", 5.392875, 5.678583], ["en", 5.690458, 5.785708], ["un", 5.797625, 5.90475], ["submarino", 5.916666, 6.404749], ["especial", 6.416666, 6.928582], ["sin", 7.142875, 7.34525], ["tocar", 7.357125, 7.690458], ["el", 7.702375, 7.821416], ["agua", 7.833333, 8.166666]], "dur": 8.516665999999999}, {"text": "¿Quieres ver lo siguiente? ¿Qué pasaría si caes dentro de un volcán? Sígueme y comenta.", "words": [["Quieres", 0.097625, 0.478583], ["ver", 0.490458, 0.669041], ["lo", 0.680958, 0.752374], ["siguiente", 0.764291, 1.323832], ["Qué", 2.142875, 2.273833], ["pasaría", 2.285708, 2.714291], ["si", 2.726208, 2.880958], ["caes", 2.892875, 3.214291], ["dentro", 3.226208, 3.523833], ["de", 3.535708, 3.630958], ["un", 3.642875, 3.761916], ["volcán", 3.773791, 4.261874], ["Sígueme", 5.083333, 5.559541], ["y", 5.571416, 5.642832], ["comenta", 5.65475, 6.190458]], "dur": 6.540457999999999}]}